flowchart TB;
  A[Caller] -->|call:init| C((Server))
  C -->|call:ringing| D{Client Status}
  D -.-|online| Z[Receiver]
  Z --> B[Show Incoming Call Screen]
  D -.-|offline| E[Send Data-only Notification]
  E -.-|wake app| K[Process CallKit Incoming]
  K -.- Z
  C -->|call:accept:ack| A
  A --> F[C Main Call Screen]
  B -.- G[/call:accept/]
  G --> C
  G --> J[R Main Call Screen]
  B -->|call:terminate(hangup)| C
  J -->|call:terminate| C
  C -->|call:terminate:ack| A
  F -->|call:terminate(hangup)| C
  C -->|call:terminate:ack| Z
  
  %% K -->|accept| F
  %% B -->|reject| G[Send Reject Signal]
  %% K -->|reject| G
  %% G -->|notify| H[Notify Caller]
  %% H -->|end call| I[End Call]
  %% F -->|end call| I

